---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BlogCard from "../components/BlogCard.astro";

const title = "What is Aadhar Card: Benefits, Features, and How to Get It";
const description = "Everything you need to know about the 12-digit unique identity number issued by UIDAI for residents of India.";
const canonicalURL = "https://techfixsteps.com/what-is-aadhar-card";
const date = "May 14, 2026";
const category = "Government";
---

<Layout 
  title={title} 
  description={description}
  canonicalURL={canonicalURL}
  image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610056494052-6a4f83a8368c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200"
  article={true}
>
  <article class="py-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="bg-secondary/10 text-secondary px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">{category}</span>
        <span class="text-text-muted text-sm">• {date}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-text-main mb-6 leading-[1.2]">
        {title}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-secondary pl-6 py-2 italic">
        {description}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-3xl p-8 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 m-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-secondary"><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="3.01" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"></line><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="3.01" y2="18"></line></svg>
        In this article
      </h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 list-none p-0 m-0">
        <li><a href="#introduction" class="text-text-muted hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-sm font-medium">What is Aadhar?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#features" class="text-text-muted hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-sm font-medium">Key Features</a></li>
        <li><a href="#benefits" class="text-text-muted hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-sm font-medium">Benefits of Aadhar</a></li>
        <li><a href="#apply" class="text-text-muted hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-sm font-medium">How to Apply</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq" class="text-text-muted hover:text-secondary transition-colors text-sm font-medium">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <h2 id="introduction">Introduction to Aadhar</h2>
      <p>Aadhar is a 12-digit unique identity number that can be obtained voluntarily by the residents of India, based on their biometric and demographic data. The data is collected by the Unique Identification Authority of India (UIDAI), a statutory authority established in January 2009 by the Government of India.</p>

      <h2 id="features">Key Features of Aadhar</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 my-10">
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🆔</div>
          <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-2 m-0">Uniqueness</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted m-0">Eliminates duplicate and fake identities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🌍</div>
          <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-2 m-0">Portability</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted m-0">A single identity used across India.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">⚡</div>
          <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-2 m-0">Online Auth</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted m-0">Instant verification anytime, anywhere.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="benefits">Benefits of Having an Aadhar Card</h2>
      <p>Aadhar has become the cornerstone of digital governance in India. Here are its primary advantages:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT):</strong> Subsidies for gas, kerosene, and other government schemes are directly credited to Aadhar-linked bank accounts.</li>
        <li><strong>Simplified KYC:</strong> Aadhar serves as a valid document for both identity and address proof, making it easier to open bank accounts or get new mobile connections.</li>
        <li><strong>Income Tax:</strong> Linking Aadhar with PAN is mandatory for filing income tax returns.</li>
        <li><strong>Digital Locker:</strong> Access to DigiLocker, allowing you to store and share electronic versions of your documents.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="apply">How to Apply for Aadhar Card</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Locate a Center:</strong> Find an authorized Aadhar Enrollment Center near your location.</li>
        <li><strong>Visit with Documents:</strong> Carry proof of identity (POI) and proof of address (POA).</li>
        <li><strong>Biometric Capture:</strong> Your fingerprints, iris scan, and a live photograph will be taken at the center.</li>
        <li><strong>Acknowledgment Slip:</strong> Collect the slip containing your 14-digit Enrollment ID (EID).</li>
        <li><strong>Download E-Aadhar:</strong> Once processed, you can download your electronic Aadhar from the UIDAI website.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <div class="mt-20" id="faq">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-text-main mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-10 h-1 bg-secondary rounded-full"></span>
        Common Questions
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {[
          { q: "Is Aadhar card a proof of citizenship?", a: "No, Aadhar is a proof of identity and residence, not a proof of citizenship." },
          { q: "Can I update my Aadhar details online?", a: "Yes, you can update your address online. For biometrics, mobile number, or email updates, you must visit an enrollment center." },
          { q: "What is masked Aadhar?", a: "Masked Aadhar allows you to hide the first 8 digits of your Aadhar number in your downloaded e-Aadhar for extra security." }
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mb-2 m-0">{item.q}</h4>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm m-0">{item.a}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Newsletter -->
    <div class="mt-20 bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-3xl p-10 text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Government Policy Alerts</h3>
      <p class="text-text-muted mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">Stay informed about new government schemes and document requirements.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto">
        <input type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" class="bg-bg-base border border-border-card px-6 py-3 rounded-xl flex-1 text-text-main outline-none focus:border-secondary transition-colors" />
        <button class="bg-secondary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">Notify Me</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related -->
    <section class="mt-12 sm:mt-20 pt-8 sm:pt-12 border-t border-border-card">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 sm:mb-8">Related Articles</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-8">
        <BlogCard title="How to Open a Savings Account in SBI" href="/how-to-open-sbi-account" date="May 15, 2026" />
        <BlogCard title="Best Mutual Fund Plans for 2026" href="/best-mutual-fund-plan" date="May 13, 2026" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
